      "problem": "Calculate ${log}_{8}⁡(32)$ without using a calculator.",
      "worked_solution": "We use the change of base formula:\n\n$$\n{log}_{a}⁡X=\\frac{{log}_{b}⁡X}{{log}_{b}⁡a}\n$$\n\nIn our case, $a=8,$ and $X=32.$ Since both $a$ and $X$ are powers of $2,$ we set $b=2.$ So, we have:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{log}_{8}⁡(32) & =\\frac{{log}_{2}⁡(32)}{{log}_{2}⁡(8)} \\\\  & =\\frac{{log}_{2}⁡({2}^{5})}{{log}_{2}⁡({2}^{3})} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$",
